WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.950
Which cloud?

2
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:05.775
A GCC Moderate estate's subscriptions
are commercial Azure, so the settings

3
00:00:05.775 --> 00:00:10.600
name the Azure Cloud, and the source
links are on management dot azure dot com.

4
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.587
There's no default: an
unknown cloud name throws.

5
00:00:13.587 --> 00:00:18.142
Learn's Service Health samples for
Resource Graph run in commercial Azure,

6
00:00:18.142 --> 00:00:20.125
with the cloud set to Azure Cloud.

7
00:00:20.125 --> 00:00:22.663
The danger is a reader in the wrong cloud.

8
00:00:22.663 --> 00:00:25.958
Subscriptions read from
another cloud return nothing,

9
00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:28.251
and the gate would pass on an empty list.

10
00:00:28.251 --> 00:00:30.129
So the settings name the cloud,

11
00:00:30.129 --> 00:00:34.630
and the live invoker refuses an Azure
command line set to another cloud.
